; Frozen proof-only inputs for the CP/M adapter tests, not a production map.
; Production authority remains cpm22-target-memory-map.asmi and
; platform-services-abi.asmi; native proof tests check the complete expressions
; on which these selected values depend. The full transient checks the real map.
CSWKBASE EQU $5858
SRCPARTS EQU 8
SRCCHUNK EQU $7500
NSTATINV EQU 1
NSTATNF  EQU 3
NSTATCAP EQU 4
NSTATIO  EQU 6
NSTATCF  EQU 7
DOWKBASE EQU $5820
DOBUF    EQU $7800
DOBUFEND EQU $D500
DOIMG    EQU $0800
DOIMGCAP EQU $5D00
DOIMGEND EQU $6500
DOOFFSET EQU $7000
DOWRBASE EQU $5800
PRRESLIM EQU $5800
PRWKLIM  EQU $6000

; All four adapter proofs occupy the host-code region before their own stubs.
            ORG $4100
